stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> normal
    normal --> interested: button / approach
    normal --> happy: touch
    normal --> sleepy: idle (no input 6.0 s)
    normal --> afraid: near (d <= 0.20 m)
    interested --> happy: touch
    interested --> normal: timeout 2.0 s / clear / fault
    interested --> afraid: near
    happy --> interested: button / approach
    happy --> normal: timeout 2.0 s / clear / fault
    happy --> afraid: near
    sleepy --> interested: button / approach
    sleepy --> happy: touch
    sleepy --> normal: clear / fault
    sleepy --> afraid: near
    afraid --> normal: clear (C1: d >= 0.28 m) / fault
    note right of afraid
      guard: touch, button, approach,
      timeout, idle are held (no exit)
    end note
